  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police has reassigned three generals linked to the alleged illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto's communications.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Three police generals have been reassigned to the Yanma Polri following their designation as suspects in an illegal wiretapping case.",
